### [ ] T11: Fallback Properly When Matched Rule Has No `style`

- **Files:** [`src/core/engine.js:209, 216, 223, 228`](file:///c:/Users/Omid/X/Code/autotheme/src/core/engine.js#L209)
- **Problem:** If a matched rule lacks a `style` property (e.g. var-only rule passed to `auto()`), `auto()` returns `undefined` instead of `fallback`.
- **Action Plan:**
